{"page":170,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:156","surah":7,"ayah":156,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَٱكْتُبْ لَنَا فِى هَـٰذِهِ ٱلدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ إِنَّا هُدْنَآ إِلَيْكَ ۚ قَالَ عَذَابِىٓ أُصِيبُ بِهِۦ مَنْ أَشَآءُ ۖ وَرَحْمَتِى وَسِعَتْ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ ۚ فَسَأَكْتُبُهَا لِلَّذِينَ يَتَّقُونَ وَيُؤْتُونَ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ وَٱلَّذِينَ هُم بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Grant us good things in this world and in the life to come. We turn to You.’ God said, ‘I bring My punishment on whoever I will, but My mercy encompasses all things. ‘I shall ordain My mercy for those who are conscious of God and pay the prescribed alms; who believe in Our Revelations;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَٱكْتُبْ","en_gloss":"And ordain","transliteration":"wa-uk'tub","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"[the] world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَسَنَةًۭ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanatan","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَفِى","en_gloss":"and in","transliteration":"wafī","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُدْنَآ","en_gloss":"we have turned","transliteration":"hud'nā","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"to You","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابِىٓ","en_gloss":"My punishment ","transliteration":"ʿadhābī","verse_key":"7:156"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أُصِيبُ","en_gloss":"I afflict","transliteration":"